error.restic.return_code.locked:
restic {phase} exited with code {return_code} after {duration_seconds}s
{output}

The output indicates that the repository is still locked. Run {unlock_command} after confirming no other restic process is using this repository.

error.snapshot.return_code.repository_no:
restic snapshots --json exited with code {return_code}
{output}

The output indicates that the repository is not initialized. Confirm repository/password settings, then run {init_command} to initialize it.

error.snapshot.return_code.locked:
restic snapshots --json exited with code {return_code}
{output}

The output indicates that the repository is still locked. Locks prevent multiple restic processes from writing to the repository at the same time; run {unlock_command} only after confirming no other backup, restore, maintenance, or external restic client is using this repository.
